 "texts": [
  "Wanderer, your footsteps are the path and nothing more; Wanderer, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, there is no path; paths are made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footsteps are the path, And nothing more; Walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footprints are the road, and nothing else; walker, there is no road, the road is made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footprints are the path and nothing more; walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footsteps are the path and nothing else; walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.\n- Antonio Machado",
  "Traveler, there is no path: paths are made by walking.",
  "Wayfarer, your footprints are the path, and nothing else; wayfarer, there is no path, it is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Whoever walks, leaves footprints; the path is not found, the path is made while you walk.",
  "Traveler, there is no path, paths are made by walking.\n-via Antonio Machado",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no way, the way is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are the way and nothing else; traveler, there is no way, make a path as you go.",
  "traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "“Traveler, there is no path; paths are made for walking.”\nEnglish translation: “Walker, your footprints are the path and nothing else; traveler, there is no path; we make our path by walking.”",
  "Walker, are your footsteps the way and nothing more; walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footsteps are the path and nothing more; walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Traveller, your footprints are the way, and nothing more; traveller, there is no way, the way is made by walking.",
