  "Traveler, your footsteps are the road, and nothing more. Traveler, there is no road; the road is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the path, and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking. (Antonio Machado)",
  "Walker, your footprints are the path, nothing more: walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footprints are the road and nothing more; nothing more; walker, there is no way, you make your road by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are the path, and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
