  "Traveler, your footprints are the way and nothing more; traveler, there is no way, the way is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your trails are the only path, traveler, there is no path, you make your own path as you walk",
  "Walker, your footpaths the path and nothing else; walker, there is no path, there is the path you make as you go.",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Wayfarer, your footsteps are the road and nothing more; wayfarer, there is no road, the road is made by walking.",
  "Walker, your footprints are the only road, nothing else; walker, there is no road, a road is made as you travel.",
  "Traveller, your footprints are the path and nothing more; traveller, there is no way, the way is made as you go. (Antonio Machado)",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are the road, and nothing more; Traveler, there is no road. The road is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are the road, and nothing more; traveler, there is no road, you make your own path as you walk.",
  "Wayfarer, your footsteps are the road, and nothing more; wayfarer, there is no road, the road is made by walking.",
  "(Antonio Machado)",
  "Traveller, your footsteps are the road, and nothing more; there is no road, only a trail, you make the trail as you walk.",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing more; traveler, there is no path, the path is created as you walk.",
  "O traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing else; traveler, there is no path, the path is made by walking.\n(Attributed anonymously in the first Spanish edition of the film The Path, https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_camino_(poema))",
  "You make the road by walking.",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the way and nothing more: traveler, there is no way, the way is made by walking.",
