  "Walker, your footsteps are the path, and nothing more; walker, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "If you walk enough, the way will appear.",
  "Wayfarer, your footsteps are the way and nothing more; wayfarer, there is no way, the way is made from walking.",
  "Walkers, are your footsteps the path and nothing more, walkers, no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Traveller, your footsteps are the way, and nothing more; traveller, there is no path, the path is made by walking.",
  "Traveler, there is no path, and not one path to follow; the path was created by you, while you traveled.",
