  "Traveller, the footprints are the path, and nothing else; Traveller, there is no path, one makes the path walking.",
  "Traveler, your footsteps are your road, nothing more. Traveler, there is no road, it is the road that is made as one travels.",
  "Traveler, your footprints are the path and nothing more, traveler, there is no path, you make your own path as you walk.",
  "Wayfarer, your footsteps are your path and nothing more;\nwayfarer, there is no path, you create the path as you walk.",
  "Walker, your footprints are the path, nothing but; walker, there is no way, the road is made by walking.",
